{
  "name": "堕影冥界印记刺青 Shadowfell Brand Tattoo",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/tools/scribal/burnisher-tooth.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\">覆盖区域：一条肢体</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">该魔法刺青用一根特殊的针制作，绘有深色的抽象图案。</span> <br /><em><strong>刺青同调 </strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。同调此物品时，你需要将针持握，并抵在你想要让刺</span><span class=\"GramE\">青出现</span>的那处皮肤上。当同调完成时，针头会化为墨水再变成刺青。若你与刺青的同调结束，刺青会消失，针头会再次出现在你的位置中。<br /><em><strong>阴影精粹</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。你获得</span>60<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">尺的黑暗视觉，并且你在敏捷（隐匿）检定上具有优势。</span><br /><em><strong>幽影防御 </strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。当你受到伤害时，你可以用一个反应变为非实体形态，将受到的伤害减半。直到下次日落前，这个反应不能再次使用。</span></p></div></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
